OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and occasional rain
OL,7,Fthrough the evening and night. Mist
OL,8,Fand fog patches developing where skies
OL,9,Fclear for any length of time.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA cloudy morning with patchy
OL,12,Frain. Becoming drier through the
OL,13,Fafternoon with some brighter spells
OL,14,Fpossibly developing from the north.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,17,Fbe dry and cold on Friday and Saturday
OL,18,Fwith long sunny spells and overnight
OL,19,Ffrost. Dry on Sunday.
